          "text": "Description: On October 17, 1980, at 11:15 PM, several witnesses saw two powerful headlights arrive at an altitude of approximately 200 meters. When the headlights turned left, the witnesses observed a dark object \"in the shape of a scallop shell\" with two fixed red lights on the sides. The object emitted a deep noise. It is very likely that the witnesses saw an unidentified aircraft that could be a dirigible balloon.",
